<title>UK: BOE sets maturity ranges for Q1 gilt auctions.</title>
<headline>BOE sets maturity ranges for Q1 gilt auctions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England set the following maturity ranges for gilt-edged auctions in the first quarter of 1997:</p>
<p> auction date	   maturity range</p>
<p> Jan 28		   2006-2008</p>
<p> Jan 30		   2001-2003</p>
<p> Feb 26		   2021 or after</p>
<p> March 26		 2006-2008</p>
<p>NOTE - full details on the stock to be auctioned will be announced on the Tuesday of the week preceding the auction.</p>
</text>
